# BlockFinaX environment template — copy to .env and fill in real values.
# .env is gitignored. Never commit real secrets.

# ── Database (Neon Postgres) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@host/dbname

# ── Pricing engine ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# All historical price data now comes from Yahoo Finance (no API key, no signup).
# See server/pricing/data/pairs.ts for the full registry.
#
# TWELVEDATA_API_KEY is OPTIONAL — only needed if you re-enable any
# `source: "twelvedata"` pair in pairs.ts. Free tier "Global trial symbols"
# does not include frontier-EM FX, so we moved everything to Yahoo.
# TWELVEDATA_API_KEY=

# Optional: override Treasury Direct base URL (defaults to fiscaldata.treasury.gov).
# TREASURY_DIRECT_BASE_URL=

# Pricing-engine signer key (ECDSA). Quotes are signed; the on-chain Diamond
# verifies the recovered signer matches `pricingEngineSigner`. Generate with:
#   node -e "console.log(require('ethers').Wallet.createRandom().privateKey)"
# Then set the matching public address on-chain via setPricingEngineSigner(addr).
PRICING_ENGINE_PRIVATE_KEY=

# ── On-chain settlement ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
DEPLOYER_PRIVATE_KEY=
DIAMOND_ADDRESS=
BASE_DIAMOND_ADDRESS=
BSC_DIAMOND_ADDRESS=
LISK_RPC_URL=
BASE_RPC_URL=
BSC_RPC_URL=

# ── Other (existing) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Add as needed. See server/index.ts and server/routes/* for what's read.
